#. module: rental_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:rental_management.penalty_invoice_mail_template_for_sale_contract
msgid ""
"<span>\n"
"                    Dear <strong t-esc=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>,\n"
"                </span>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    We hope this message finds you well. Our records indicate that your invoice <t t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\" t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_invoice_id.invoice_id.name\"/> linked to <t t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\" t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_id.sold_seq\"/> was due on <t t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\" t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_invoice_id.invoice_id.invoice_date_due\"/>. As the payment has not been received within the grace period of <t t-esc=\"object.penalty_days_after_due\"/> days, a penalty has now been applied in accordance with our payment policy.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    A new penalty invoice <t t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec') and object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').penalty_invoice_id.state == 'posted'\">(<t t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').penalty_invoice_id.name\"/>)</t> has been generated for the overdue amount. Please find the details below:\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <ul>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Original Invoice:</strong>\n"
"                        <span t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\" t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_invoice_id.invoice_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Due Date:</strong>\n"
"                        <span t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\" t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_invoice_id.invoice_id.invoice_date_due\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Days Overdue:</strong>\n"
"                        <span t-esc=\"object.penalty_days_after_due\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                    <li>\n"
"                        <strong>Penalty Amount:</strong>\n"
"                        <span t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\" t-field=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').amount\"/>\n"
"                    </li>\n"
"                </ul>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    We kindly request you to settle the outstanding balance at the earliest to avoid further penalties.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Thank you for your prompt attention.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"\n"
"                <h6>\n"
"                    Best regards\n"
"                </h6>\n"
"                <h5>\n"
"                    <strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </strong>\n"
"                </h5>\n"
"                <hr/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<span>\n"
"                    亲爱的 <strong t-esc=\"object.customer_id.name\"></strong>,\n"
"                </span>\n"
"<p>\n"
"                    我们希望您能顺利收到此消息。我们的记录表明您的发票 <t t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_invoice_id.invoice_id.name\" t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\"></t> 链接到 <t t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_id.sold_seq\" t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\"></t> 到期日为 <t t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_invoice_id.invoice_id.invoice_date_due\" t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\"></t>。由于在宽限期内尚未收到付款 <t t-esc=\"object.penalty_days_after_due\"></t> 天，现已根据我们的付款政策处以罚款。\n"
"                </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"                    新的罚款发票 <t t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec') and object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').penalty_invoice_id.state == 'posted'\">(<t t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').penalty_invoice_id.name\"></t>)</t> 已生成逾期金额。请参阅以下详细信息：\n"
"                </p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>\n"
"<strong>原始发票：</strong>\n"
"<span t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_invoice_id.invoice_id.name\" t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\"></span>\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li>\n"
"<strong>两个日期：</strong>\n"
"<span t-esc=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').sale_contract_invoice_id.invoice_id.invoice_date_due\" t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\"></span>\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li>\n"
"<strong>逾期天数：</strong>\n"
"<span t-esc=\"object.penalty_days_after_due\"></span>\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li>\n"
"<strong>罚款金额：</strong>\n"
"<span t-field=\"object.env.context.get('penalty_rec').amount\" t-if=\"ctx.get('penalty_rec')\"></span>\n"
"</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>\n"
"                    我们恳请您尽早结清未清余额，以避免进一步处罚。\n"
"                </p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"                    感谢您的及时关注。\n"
"                </p>\n"
"<h6>\n"
"                    此致\n"
"                </h6>\n"
"<h5>\n"
"<strong>\n"
"<t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"></t>\n"
"</strong>\n"
"</h5>\n"
"<hr/>\n"
"<span>\n"
"<t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"></t>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"></t>\n"
"</span>\n"

